24,-0.03678726,-0.00998636,0.0022422,-0.02974458,0.00662263,-0.02980997,-0.02896135,-0.00288243,0.05949301,-0.00322503,0.09263463,-0.05961226,-0.00633638,0.00371466,0.01217295,-0.03381179,0.00286854,-0.06929743,0.04200397,-0.02517302,0.18452275,-0.00621466,0.02325902,0.00585891,-0.05144945,-0.02956425,0.00390227,0.02246297,0.00717176,0.01324586,0.10887566,-0.00170254,0.02194018,0.01136589,-0.01373669,-0.02476221,-0.01646939,-0.00538876,0.0331958,0.00152618,-0.04923838,-0.03940637,0.08700183,0.00653969,-0.00520165,-0.07628368,0.00109937,0.00480528,-0.00509711,0.01897719,-0.00487966,-0.00342182,0.064105,-0.03648871,-0.01782177,0.00654381,0.02729012,-0.00758053,0.02312537,0.03451794,-0.00200855,0.07527163,-0.04412487],"last_embed":{"hash":"51e6wh","tokens":462}}},"last_read":{"hash":"51e6wh","at":1769791475810},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1769791401257,"size":5154,"at":1769791474147,"hash":"51e6wh"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation":[20,42],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#{1}":[21,25],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,28],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[29,31],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[32,34],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[33,34],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[35,37],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[36,37],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[38,40],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[41,42],"#Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)#{1}":[42,42]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/RWZCNDZU","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/RKBFCLYY?page=1&annotation=S7R4IZHN","line":33},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/RKBFCLYY?page=1&annotation=6DKKWP9Z","line":36},{"title":"Sayfa 4","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/RKBFCLYY?page=4&annotation=9LFSML73","line":42}],"metadata":{"Title":"Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation","Authors":"Lin-Chun Wang, Hanjie Zhang, Nancy Ginsberg, Andrea Nandorine Ban, Jeroen P. Kooman, Peter Kotanko","Year":2024,"DOI":"10.1053/j.jrn.2024.09.001","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"We tasked ChatGPT-4 with generating a personalized daily meal plan, including nutritional information. Virtual ‘‘patients’’ were generated through Monte Carlo simulation; data from a randomly selected virtual patient were presented to ChatGPT. We provided to ChatGPT patient demographics, food preferences, laboratory data, clinical characteristics, and available budget, to generate a oneday sample menu with recipes and nutritional analyses. The resulting daily recipe recommendations, cooking instructions, and nutritional analyses were reviewed and rated on a five-point Likert scale by an experienced renal dietitian. In addition, the generated content was rated by a renal dietitian and compared with a U. S. Department of Agriculture–approved nutrient analysis software. ChatGPT also analyzed nutrition information of two recipes published online. We also requested a translation of the output into Spanish, Mandarin, Hungarian, German, and Dutch.","Findings":"The renal dietitian rated the recipes at 3 (3, 3) [median (Q1, Q3)], the cooking instructions at 5 (5,5), and the nutritional analysis at 2 (2, 2) on the five-point Likert scale. ChatGPT’s nutritional analysis underestimated calories by 36% (95% CI: 44-88%), protein by 28% (25-167%), fat 48% (29-81%), phosphorus 54% (15-102%), potassium 49% (40-68%), and sodium 53% (14-139%). The nutritional analysis of online available recipes differed only by 0 to 35%. The translations were rated as reliable by native speakers (4 on the five-point Likert scale).","Conclusions":"","Limitations":"LLMs like ChatGPT show promise for providing personalized nutritional guidance to dialysis patients, but significant improvements are necessary. At present, ChatGPT’s nutritional recommendations are not a substitute for personalized medical advice. However, it can be a useful tool for generating meal plans that renal dietitians can then evaluate and adjust according to reference values from validated sources.","User_Notes":""},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"51e6wh","at":1769791475672}},"smart_blocks:Application of ChatGPT to Support Nutritional Recommendations for Dialysis Patients – A Qualitative and Quantitative Evaluation.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"embeddings":{"TaylorAI/bge-micro-v2":{"vec":[-0.03054515,0.04085495,-0.0035805,-0.04206907,-0.04582671,0.03011263,-0.02713205,0.06751692,